OL,9,G0855 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,10,     FThe boys head to Wokingham in
OL,11,     FBerkshire to meet professional
OL,12,     Fgardener Mark, whose barns are
OL,13,     Fbursting with bikes, bric-a-brac
OL,14,     Fand baggage.
OL,15,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,16,     FThe first visit is to Harrogate,
OL,17,     Fwhere management team 'Clarkey'
OL,18,     Fand Katie help to run the
OL,19,     F64-bedroom White Hart Hotel. The
OL,20,     Fextra charge for posh coffee at
OL,21,     Fbreakfast causes a stir.
