OL,5,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe second visit is to Raouf and
OL,7,     Fhis friend Chrissie at the New
OL,8,     FPromenade Hotel in Blackpool.
OL,9,     FThere's a teetering toilet seat,
OL,10,     Fand Clarkey and Katie are turned
OL,11,     Foff by muck on the taps.
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FVicky Crawford welcomes her rivals
OL,14,     Fto her aptly named terrace house,
OL,15,     FThe Terrace, in Oxford. Two pairs
OL,16,     Fof guests make some grim
OL,17,     Fdiscoveries, including hairs and a
OL,18,     Fpre-sucked sweet.
