OL,5,G1135 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe final visit is to Robin and
OL,7,     FLiza's Georgian mansion, Tall
OL,8,     FJohn's House, in the Brecon
OL,9,     FBeacons. The guests gush over
OL,10,     Ftheir new friendships, but Vicky
OL,11,     Fdoesn't seem to share the
OL,12,     Fsentiment.
OL,13,G1210 Four in a Bed
OL,14,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,15,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,16,     Ffor the last time to settle some
OL,17,     Fscores. There's anger as well as
OL,18,     Ftears of joy when the winner is
OL,19,     Frevealed.
